{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12367","headline":"送王使君赴太原行营 · 钱起","name":"送王使君赴太原行营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太白明无象，皇威未戢戈。\n诸侯持节钺，千里控山河。\n汉驿双旌度，胡沙七骑过。\n惊蓬连雁起，牧马入云多。\n不卖卢龙塞，能消瀚海波。\n须传出师颂，莫奏式微歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}